## laptop · shields down · verify → ✋
rc=1
   ✋ ConstraintError: this laptop accepts inbound tailnet traffic (shields down)
      ⇒ a laptop reaches out and is never reached in; any service it listens on is open to the tailnet
      fix: sudo -v && rhx grove.provision --what 5.23.tailscale --mode apply
writes: none

