## laptop · tagged · verify → ✋ (a laptop never takes tag:camp)
rc=1
   ✋ ConstraintError: this laptop carries tags 'tag:camp'
      ⇒ the invariant 'a laptop never takes tag:camp' is broken
      ⇒ log it out and sign in as yourself:
          sudo tailscale logout && sudo -v && rhx grove.provision --what 5.23.tailscale --mode apply
writes: none

## laptop · no camp peer · verify → ✋
rc=1
   ✋ ConstraintError: joined as a member, but no camp grove (tag:camp) is a peer
      ⇒ three causes: no camp grove is a node of this tailnet yet (none joined
        by its provisioner, or each one removed); this laptop signed in to
        another tailnet; or the camp's acl does not grant this login a camp grove
      ⇒ none joined yet: the provisioner's join is owed (ahbode/infrastructure)
      ⇒ another tailnet: sudo tailscale logout, then rerun and sign in to the camp's tailnet:
          sudo -v && rhx grove.provision --what 5.23.tailscale --mode apply
writes: none

