## case 3 [t0] · bare laptop, no client, no source · verify → ✋, names the fix
rc=1
   ✋ ConstraintError: tailscale is not on PATH
      ⇒ the one package brings the client and tailscaled, so the daemon is not read apart
   ✋ ConstraintError: tailscale's signed apt source is not declared as this bundle writes it
      want: deb [signed-by=<fixture>/tailscale.gpg] https://pkgs.tailscale.com/stable/ubuntu <codename> main in <fixture>/tailscale.list
      and:  <fixture>/tailscale.gpg with primary 2596A99EAAB33821893C0A79458CA832957F5868
      ⇒ a commented-out line, a stale codename, or a swapped key all read here:
        without the exact source, `apt upgrade` never brings tailscale current
      fix: sudo -v && rhx grove.provision --what 5.23.tailscale --mode apply
writes: none

